{"id":"en_fated-consort-to-the-midnight-pontiff","title":"Fated Consort to the Midnight Pontiff","titleEn":"Fated Consort to the Midnight Pontiff","description":"Nancy, an orphan taken in by the avaricious Sullivan family, finds herself stripped of the inheritance left by her parents and pushed into a life she never chose. The story follows her struggle against those who would exploit her circumstances, set against the backdrop of a powerful religious figure known as the Midnight Pontiff. Her path becomes entangled with this enigmatic pontiff as she navigates loss, coercion, and the fight to reclaim what is rightfully hers. Those interested in following how this conflict unfolds can watch the series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_fated-consort-to-the-midnight-pontiff/cover.jpg","backdrop":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_fated-consort-to-the-midnight-pontiff/cover.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["دراما قصيرة","الحضر","من الصفر إلى بطل","الانتقام","limited_free","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsfyk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_fated-consort-to-the-midnight-pontiff_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsfyk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fated-consort-to-the-midnight-pontiff_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsfyk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fated-consort-to-the-midnight-pontiff_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsfyk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"